 The main program controls the overall blood bank system. It calls different functions based on the user's choice. Donor-related functions handle registration, eligibility checking and searching. Stock-related functions update and issue blood units. File functions save and load donor and stock information. This modular design reduces code duplication and improves maintainability.
 
